  "question": {
    "text": "Let the sum of the first three terms of an A.P. be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>39</mn></math> and the sum of its last four terms be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>178</mn></math>. If the first term of this A.P. is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the median of the A.P. is :",
