  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the A.P. be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8943;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>l</mi></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math><br />Where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> is the first term and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi></math> is the last term,<br />Sum of <math><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>terms is,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>39</mn></math>.<br /><math><mn>30</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>39</mn></math> as <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math> (Given)<br /><math><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br />Sum of last <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math> terms is<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>178</mn></math>.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>l</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>178</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>49</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mn>46</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>49</mn></math><br />Let number of terms are,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math>term&nbsp;is<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>49</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>14</mn></math><br />So the median of the series would be mean of <math><msup><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math> term<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#8901;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>59</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>29.5</mn></math><br /><br /><strong>Alternate way</strong><br />The median would be mean of 10 and 49, That is 29.5.",
